     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Xueping,<div>Does this error still persist in the latest version of GGIR?</div><div>I see on <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_tz_database_time_zones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_tz_database_time_zones&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792491495009000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1et-2sTuw25VvHdR_XpeU7\">wikipedia</a> that \r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\">America/New_York is not exactly the same as EST, which is</span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\"><font color=\"#000000\"> \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=America/Cancun&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"America/Cancun (page does not exist)\" style=\"text-decoration:none;background:none rgb(248,249,250);font-family:sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title%3DAmerica/Cancun%26action%3Dedit%26redlink%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792491495009000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2WyuGFVpowCLo3eEtdTeLT\">America/Cancun</a>. Maybe that </font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\">explains your error? Timestamps can exist in one timezone but not in the other when clock changes happen in a different hour of the night.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Thanks, Vincent</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">PS: Please try to post issues on <a href=\"https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/issues&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792491495009000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JZF9430blE7sArrsaVMSp\">https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/issues</a> next time, as that makes it easier to handle them.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;display:inline\"><br></span></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
